  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC_SyncVideoPlayer forces me to choose the videos in the playlist up-front, so even if I want to make a redirector, I have to hard-code hundreds of placeholder URLs into the component in order to cater for a playlist as long as you want.\n\nIt would be much simpler if we could input a URL to a single file (JSON or whatever) which then contains the list of URLs to use.\n\n(Support for YouTube playlist URLs would be nice too, but I already gave up on YouTube for my videos so I'd want to be able to self-host it.)",
